%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 416957903ce8daa4cbf8b3a61dc43588, type: 3}
  m_Name: KoiTutorialDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueInstance
  steps:
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: Oh! You're home early. I didn't expect you until tonight.
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f4dd71feaee8d84ab55b30b45a37c8e, type: 3}
    text: ...
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: Just because we can't cuddle right now doesn't mean I'm not happy to
      see you. I have multiple priorities! :<
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f4dd71feaee8d84ab55b30b45a37c8e, type: 3}
    text: ......
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: I don't deny that some priorities are... bigger than others.
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: Actually, perfect timing. Spike just moved into the old balloon across
      town, and I wrote them a welcome letter.
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: I tucked in a pressed flower. It's less intense than a bouquet. Right?
      Probably.
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f4dd71feaee8d84ab55b30b45a37c8e, type: 3}
    text: ...
  - characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 739841fa48a2e7148997e9a9aef1d933, type: 3}
    text: Please take it before I rethink every word.
